message: "If you use this software, game, or data, please cite the associated paper (see preferred-citation) and/or this repository."
title: "Circuit Surge"
abstract: "A two-player board game for teaching series and parallel resistor and capacitor circuits, balance-tested via AI self-play before classroom deployment. This repository contains the game (print-ready materials and a digital engine), the self-play balance-testing code and data, and anonymized classroom pilot data."
authors:
